{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And when you bring.</b> It says <b>and when</b> with an added vav to connect this matter to the preceding topic — to tell you that also regarding the specifics of the meal-offering, the anointed priest is included, and the congregation is diminished, both for the conditions of the manner of offering that are recorded in the handful of the meal-offering of fine flour, and also to bring frankincense even though it was not mentioned in it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:52:39.481695748Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}